> Does anyone have a good summary of what the measurementInvariance() output produces? I am trying to figure out what fit.loadings, fit.intercepts, fit.means is.

Those names describe what type of parameter is (additionally) constrained to equality.
See the ?`measurementInvariance-deprecated` help page.

